Distance Estimation Method for Mandelbrots set ( DEM/M ) estimates distance from point c{\\displaystyle c\\,}![{\displaystyle c\,}](https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/8573e7d95140b0d4068258d8162e189563baee6b) ( in the exterior of Mandelbrot set ) to nearest point in Mandelbrot set.[\[1\]](https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Fractals/Iterations_in_the_complex_plane/demm#cite_note-1)[\[2\]](https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Fractals/Iterations_in_the_complex_plane/demm#cite_note-2)

